# Nuvora Core

Nuvora is a production-oriented, multi-tenant parking management SaaS.

## Priorities
1. Correctness
2. Security
3. Tenant isolation
4. Data integrity
5. Maintainability
6. Testability
7. Performance

Before changing code, inspect the relevant module, dependencies, existing conventions, and tests.

Do not introduce microservices into the core application. Nuvora Cloud is a Modular Monolith.

Never place business rules in controllers, Vue components, migrations, jobs, or generic helpers when they belong to the domain/application layer.

Never trust tenant_id supplied by the client. Tenant context must come from trusted application context.

Every tenant-owned resource must be isolated and tested against cross-tenant access.

Never use floating point for monetary values.

Do not log secrets, passwords, payment credentials, camera credentials, tokens, or sensitive personal data.

Prefer framework-native security and infrastructure features over custom implementations.

Do not make unrelated refactors while implementing a feature.
